From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:47:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 079/159] dt-bindings: interconnect: Add Qualcomm SM7250

Document the RPMh network-on-chip providers of SM7250. As on SM7150,
the virtual providers (mc-virt, ipa-virt, qup-virt) share the register
space of a real NoC and are described as its children.

These changes were written with the help of an LLM and checked by a human.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RmfiVDW3KWZdb9c3iDGRYg
---
 .../interconnect/qcom,sm7250-rpmh.yaml        |  79 ++++++++++
 .../interconnect/qcom,sm7250-rpmh.h           | 149 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 228 insertions(+)
